NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE

The MIT terms above apply to the source code of this project only — the HTML,
CSS and JavaScript written by the project team.

They do NOT apply to the museum material contained in this repository:

  * The photographs in assets/objects/ (all files OBJ-*.jpg)
  * The object titles, room names and curator texts in data/ and in the
    OBJECTS, TITLES, CREDITS and FACTS tables in assets/museum.js

That material belongs to the Staatliches Museum Ägyptischer Kunst, München,
is published in its Sammlung Online under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0),
and is used here with the museum's kind permission.

CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 means, for that material specifically:

  * BY   — each photograph must carry its individual photographer credit.
           The credits are listed in the CREDITS table in assets/museum.js.
  * NC   — no commercial use.
  * ND   — no cropping, filters or colour overlays on the photographs.

Anyone reusing this project under the MIT terms must therefore either obtain
their own permission from the museum, or replace the museum material with
their own.

The full text of CC BY-NC-ND 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/
